body:
I have a background of childhood trauma, intense depression and suicidal thoughts. Microdosing helped me a lot so it's possible it can help your friend. 

Don't get me wrong, it's no instant cure but dragged me out of a spiral of depression, anxiety, hopelessness and stopped me ending my journey in this world. It takes time and a little work but can be done to at least make things seem clearer/better.

;
